         - [GH #74] &yatt:param(); is now equiv of &yatt:CON:param();.
         - [GH #73] &yatt:coalesce(); now behaves like SQL's coalesce().
         - [GH #70] &yatt:file_location(); and &yatt:is_current_page(page)

    * Enhancement
         - [GH #91] Better error reporting for XHF parser
